<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2086529025"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1714589426"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="know me..."/><amll:meta key="artists" value="八木海莉"/><amll:meta key="album" value="know me..."/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:31.787"><div begin="00:12.435" end="03:26.377"><p begin="00:12.435" end="00:16.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">同じように求めてしまうから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了忍住不生出同样的渴求</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji yo u ni mo to me te shi ma u ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:16.766" end="00:18.282" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">黙って居ればいい？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要保持沉默就够了吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ma 't te i re ba i i ？</span></p><p begin="00:18.292" end="00:21.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">望むように逆さに歩いてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如你所愿走向反方向</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no zo mu yo u ni sa ka sa ni a ru i te ku</span></p><p begin="00:22.829" end="00:25.571" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">息絶えたみたいだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉似乎要窒息一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki ta e ta mi ta i da</span></p><p begin="00:25.581" end="00:28.577" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">潜在的な憂いには<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论如何也无法坦诚地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se n za i te ki na u re i ni wa</span></p><p begin="00:28.587" end="00:31.442" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">如何にも素直になれず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说出潜在的担忧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ni mo su na o ni na re zu</span></p><p begin="00:31.452" end="00:35.247" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">誰とも訳合えないね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对谁都无法分享内心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re to mo wa ke a e na i ne</span></p><p begin="00:36.070" end="00:38.203" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">自分さえも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连对自己也是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n sa e mo</span></p><p begin="00:37.319" end="00:40.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">命令 故意を感じて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命令 感觉很刻意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me i re i ko i wo ka n ji te</span></p><p begin="00:40.314" end="00:43.187" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">訂正 無為を観じて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">修正 看破了无为之意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te i se i mu i wo ka n ji te</span></p><p begin="00:43.197" end="00:46.185" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">安寧は罪が混ざる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">安宁之中混杂着罪恶</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a n ne i wa tsu mi ga ma za ru</span></p><p begin="00:46.209" end="00:48.155" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">当然か<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是当然的吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to u ze n ka</span></p><p begin="00:49.092" end="00:51.916" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">知った顔で笑っててよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用我熟知的表情微笑吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi 't ta ka o de wa ra 't te te yo</span></p><p begin="00:51.926" end="00:54.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">底知らず恐れるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我害怕深不可测的感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko shi ra zu o so re ru no</span></p><p begin="00:54.895" end="00:57.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">月並みの愛をくれよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请给我普通的爱吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ki na mi no a i wo ku re yo</span></p><p begin="00:57.937" end="01:00.351" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">You know me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">You know me.</span></p><p begin="01:00.923" end="01:03.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">知った気で踊ってるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我自认了解才与你起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi 't ta ki de o do 't te ru no</span></p><p begin="01:03.792" end="01:06.685" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">底が満たされるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心底被你充实填满</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko ga mi ta sa re ru no</span></p><p begin="01:06.730" end="01:09.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">放さないで止めないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要放手不要停下舞步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de ya me na i de</span></p><p begin="01:09.719" end="01:15.462" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">独りじゃないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我都并非孤身一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri ja na i no</span></p><p begin="01:24.544" end="01:28.694" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">描いたような人間じゃないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管我不是画中那样美好的人物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e ga i ta yo u na ni n ge n ja na i ke do</span></p><p begin="01:30.383" end="01:34.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">靠れるように居場所がほしいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍想要一个可以依靠的容身之处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo ta re ru yo u ni i ba sho ga ho shi i no</span></p><p begin="01:35.012" end="01:39.431" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">生き耐えていいの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样坚持活着也是可以的吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki ta e te i i no ？</span></p><p begin="01:37.764" end="01:40.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">顕在的なずれには<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">显然存在的分歧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke n za i te ki na zu re ni wa</span></p><p begin="01:40.694" end="01:43.592" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">心じゃ間に合わず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依靠真心也无法弥合</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ja ma ni a wa zu</span></p><p begin="01:43.602" end="01:47.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">如何しても相容れないね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论如何也不能相容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u shi te mo a i i re na i ne</span></p><p begin="01:48.230" end="01:50.431" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">触れてたいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想触碰你啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu re te ta i yo</span></p><p begin="01:49.505" end="01:52.392" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">命令 奥を解して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命令 理解我的内心吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me i re i o ku wo ka i shi te</span></p><p begin="01:52.402" end="01:55.358" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">訂正 全て害して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">修正 把一切看作有害</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te i se i su be te ga i shi te</span></p><p begin="01:55.368" end="01:58.279" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">安寧は罪が混ざる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">安宁之中混杂着罪恶</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a n ne i wa tsu mi ga ma za ru</span></p><p begin="01:58.289" end="02:00.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">当然だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是当然的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to u ze n da</span></p><p begin="02:01.283" end="02:04.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">知った顔で笑っててよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用我熟知的表情微笑吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi 't ta ka o de wa ra 't te te yo</span></p><p begin="02:04.090" end="02:07.052" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">底知らず恐れるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我害怕深不可测的感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko shi ra zu o so re ru no</span></p><p begin="02:07.062" end="02:10.053" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">月並みの愛をくれよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请给我普通的爱吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ki na mi no a i wo ku re yo</span></p><p begin="02:10.063" end="02:12.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">You know me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">You know me</span></p><p begin="02:13.025" end="02:15.925" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">知った気で重ねるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自以为了解你与你心意相合</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi 't ta ki de ka sa ne ru no</span></p><p begin="02:15.945" end="02:18.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">底が満たされるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心底被你充实填满</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko ga mi ta sa re ru no</span></p><p begin="02:18.825" end="02:21.755" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">試さないで醒めないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要考验真心不要醒来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta me sa na i de sa me na i de</span></p><p begin="02:21.765" end="02:24.831" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">話さないで離さないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要和我说话不要离开我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de ha na sa na i de</span></p><p begin="02:24.841" end="02:28.534" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">それぞれの孤独が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一种的孤独</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re zo re no ko do ku ga</span></p><p begin="02:30.810" end="02:35.166" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">美しく在るよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都很美</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u tsu ku shi ku a ru yo</span></p><p begin="02:36.495" end="02:39.402" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">分かり切れぬ淋しさと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法全然理解的寂寞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka ri ki re nu sa mi shi sa to</span></p><p begin="02:39.412" end="02:42.432" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">つもりでいる愛しさよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与酝酿之中的爱意啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu mo ri de i ru i to shi sa yo</span></p><p begin="02:42.442" end="02:48.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">見えぬ月を愛でる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眷恋着看不见的月光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi e nu tsu ki wo me de ru</span></p><p begin="02:48.363" end="02:51.214" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">知った顔で笑っててよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用我熟知的表情微笑吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi 't ta ka o de wa ra 't te te yo</span></p><p begin="02:51.263" end="02:54.136" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">底知らず恐れるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我害怕深不可测的感觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko shi ra zu o so re ru no</span></p><p begin="02:54.192" end="02:57.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">月並みの愛をくれよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请给我普通的爱吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ki na mi no a i wo ku re yo</span></p><p begin="02:57.225" end="02:59.417" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">You know me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">You know me.</span></p><p begin="03:00.100" end="03:03.086" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">知った気で謳ってるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我自认了解才为你歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi 't ta ki de u ta 't te ru no</span></p><p begin="03:03.096" end="03:05.945" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">底が満たされるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心底被你充实填满</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko ga mi ta sa re ru no</span></p><p begin="03:05.973" end="03:08.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">放さないで止めないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要放手不要停下舞步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na sa na i de ya me na i de</span></p><p begin="03:08.951" end="03:13.517" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">独りじゃないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我都并非孤身一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri ja na i no</span></p><p begin="03:12.038" end="03:13.517" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">You know me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">You know me</span></p><p begin="03:13.527" end="03:14.988" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">You know me</p><p begin="03:15.008" end="03:17.182" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">You know me</p><p begin="03:17.934" end="03:19.319" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">You know me</p><p begin="03:19.368" end="03:20.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">You know me</p><p begin="03:20.843" end="03:22.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">You know me</p><p begin="03:22.994" end="03:26.377" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">You know me</p></div></body></tt>